16:50.790 --> 16:51.770
Rahsia apa?

16:52.960 --> 16:53.730
Dia memberitahu saya...

16:53.870 --> 16:55.370
Dia ada cakap sesuatu.

16:55.390 --> 16:56.180
Apa yang dia katakan?

16:56.390 --> 16:57.300
Dia berkata...

16:58.840 --> 16:59.820
Dia berkata...

16:59.840 --> 17:00.180
Dia...

17:07.270 --> 17:08.050
Kemudian...

17:08.070 --> 17:08.940
Dan kemudian?

17:09.240 --> 17:10.050
Kemudian...

17:11.790 --> 17:13.660
