26:59.750 --> 27:01.090
Tuanku, di mana Tuanku berada?

27:01.110 --> 27:01.900
Duke Eastwood.

27:02.350 --> 27:03.660
- Tuanku.
- Duke Eastwood.

27:03.960 --> 27:04.980
- Duke Eastwood.
- Tuanku...

27:05.200 --> 27:05.900
Duke Eastwood.

27:07.240 --> 27:07.770
